74720	74785	74816	74816	she	376	" and if she asks me to stay to tea , I 'll stay . How wrong it is to neglect people because they are not pretty , and young , and merry ! And I will certainly call to see Miss Mann too . She may not be amiable , but what has made her unamiable ? What has life been to her ? "
