96244	96250	96146	96146	her	251	" At heart -- no . "
96251	96260	96281	96281	she	251	" Oh ! who nestles there , Shirley ? "
96275	96280	96281	96281	she	251	" I have dreamed , "
96284	96297	96589	96589	Shirley	251	" a mere day - dream -- certainly bright , probably baseless ! "
