129181	129239	129610	129610	his	489	" You see there is not an inch of room for you here ; but I discern plenty of space at Mrs. Boultby 's table , between Miss Armitage and Miss Birtwhistle . Go ! John Sykes will be your _ vis - à - vis _ , and you will sit with your back towards us . "
