132466	132516	132463	132463	she	257	" Omitted to bid you good - bye ! Where did you come from ? Are you fairies ? I left two like you , one in purple and one in white , standing at the top of a bank , four fields off , but a minute ago . "
132517	132568	132598	132598	he	250	" You left us there and find us here . We have been watching you , and shall watch you still . You must be questioned one day , but not now . At present all you have to do is to say good - night , and then pass . "
