132634	132660	132731	132731	his	250	" Yes , and to Caroline likewise . It is nothing new , I hope . You have bid us both good - night before . "
132752	132770	132731	132731	his	250	" Your debtor bids you good - night ! May you rest safely and serenely till morning . "
132771	132822	132731	132731	his	250	" And you , Mr. Moore -- what are you going to do ? What have you been saying to Mr. Helstone , with whom I saw you shake hands ? Why did all those gentlemen gather round you ? Put away reserve for once . Be frank with me . "
132823	132850	132857	132857	Shirley	251	" Who can resist you ? I will be frank . To - morrow , if there is anything to relate , you shall hear it . "
