136527	136572	136581	136581	Caroline	257	" Do ? Ye can do not mich , poor young lass ! Ye've gi'en your brass ; ye've done well . If ye could transport your tenant , Mr. Moore , to Botany Bay , ye'd happen do better . Folks hate him . "
