137050	137058	137046	137046	William	367	" And I 'll warrant my maister , "
137064	137073	137046	137046	William	367	" continued Joe , assuming a lordly air , "
137082	137082	137091	137091	Shirley	251	"
137083	137089	137347	137347	he	288	" I wonder what for ? "
137173	137187	137347	137347	he	288	" Because there is nought agate that fits women to be consarned in . "
